    <data key="d0">Shopline POS Integration Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmM_JnYygZM</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture showing Shopline's e-commerce platform integration with a POS system, including authentication via ECS SSO and API Gateway, and bidirectional database synchronization between Couchbase and MongoDB using Kafka and an ECS Proxy worker.</data>
    <data key="d3">e-commerce, authentication, database synchronization</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
